{"seq":2,"slug":"log-based-alerting","title":"基于日志的告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-based-alerting","wordCount":1266,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于日志的告警\">基于日志的告警</h1><p>Metrics 告警回答&quot;系统整体有没有变差&quot;，Trace 告警回答&quot;某类请求是否异常&quot;，而日志告警回答&quot;系统内部到底发生了什么具体事件&quot;。三者互补而不是替代。日志告警的独特价值在于它能捕获 metrics 无法表达的语义信息——一个 <code>database migration failed: column already exists</code> 的 ERROR 日志包含的诊断价值远超一个 <code>error_rate &gt; 0.01</code> 的 metrics 告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>日志告警通过持续查询将日志事件转化为可行动的通知。四种架构模式（存储端 Ruler、独立告警平台、管道层实时、应用层内嵌）覆盖不同延迟需求。告警类型包括计数阈值、比率检测、缺失检测（Dead Man&#39;s Switch）和模式变化。告警质量工程关注信噪比——通过 Grouping、Inhibition、Silencing 三大降噪机制和分级路由确保每条告警都需要人类行动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日志告警的架构模式\">日志告警的架构模式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    LOGS[(日志存储)] --&gt; RULER[告警规则引擎]&#10;    RULER --&gt;|持续查询| EVAL{阈值/条件判定}&#10;    EVAL --&gt;|触发| AM[Alertmanager / 告警路由]&#10;    AM --&gt; PD[PagerDuty]&#10;    AM --&gt; SLACK[Slack]&#10;    AM --&gt; WEBHOOK[Webhook]&#10;    AM --&gt; SILENCE[静默规则]\">graph LR\n    LOGS[(日志存储)] --&gt; RULER[告警规则引擎]\n    RULER --&gt;|持续查询| EVAL{阈值/条件判定}\n    EVAL --&gt;|触发| AM[Alertmanager / 告警路由]\n    AM --&gt; PD[PagerDuty]\n    AM --&gt; SLACK[Slack]\n    AM --&gt; WEBHOOK[Webhook]\n    AM --&gt; SILENCE[静默规则]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构模式</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储端 Ruler</td>\n<td>Loki Ruler / ES Watcher</td>\n<td>与数据共置，延迟低</td>\n<td>规则数有上限，调试困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立告警平台</td>\n<td>Grafana Alerting</td>\n<td>UI 友好，多数据源</td>\n<td>额外组件，查询开销双倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道层实时告警</td>\n<td>OTel Collector + routing</td>\n<td>延迟最低（无需落盘）</td>\n<td>无法做回溯分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层内嵌告警</td>\n<td>代码中直接触发事件</td>\n<td>精确控制</td>\n<td>与业务代码耦合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"loki-告警规则\">Loki 告警规则</h2><p>Loki 的 <code>ruler</code> 组件持续执行 LogQL 查询并根据结果触发告警。规则格式与 Prometheus AlertRule 完全对齐，只是查询语言从 PromQL 变成 LogQL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"groups:&#10;  - name: log-alerts&#10;    interval: 1m&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: HighErrorRate&#10;        expr: |&#10;          sum(rate({level=&quot;ERROR&quot;}[5m])) by (service_name) &gt; 0.5&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;          team: platform&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;{{ $labels.service_name }} ERROR rate &gt; 0.5/s for 5m&#39;&#10;          dashboard: &#39;https://grafana.internal/d/logs?var-service={{ $labels.service_name }}&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: DatabaseConnectionFailure&#10;        expr: |&#10;          count_over_time({service_name=~&quot;.*-service&quot;} |= &quot;connection refused&quot; |= &quot;database&quot; [5m]) &gt; 0&#10;        for: 1m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;          team: dba&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Database connection failures detected&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">log-alerts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HighErrorRate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate({level=\"ERROR\"}[5m])) by (service_name) > 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          team</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">platform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ $labels.service_name }} ERROR rate > 0.5/s for 5m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://grafana.internal/d/logs?var-service={{ $labels.service_name }}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DatabaseConnectionFailure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          count_over_time({service_name=~\".*-service\"} |= \"connection refused\" |= \"database\" [5m]) > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          team</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dba</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Database connection failures detected'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong><code>for</code> 子句的关键作用</strong>：告警表达式必须<strong>持续</strong>满足 <code>for</code> 指定的时间段才真正触发（从 Pending → Firing）。这防止了瞬时抖动产生噪声告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警类型设计\">告警类型设计</h2><h3 id=\"基于计数的告警\">基于计数的告警</h3><p>最基础的告警模式：当某类日志在时间窗口内出现次数超过阈值时触发。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Alert</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>matching_logs</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>threshold</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Alert} \\iff \\text{count}(\\text{matching\\_logs}, \\Delta t) &gt; \\text{threshold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Alert</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">matching_logs</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>适用场景：ERROR rate 异常、特定异常类爆发</p>\n<h3 id=\"基于比率的告警\">基于比率的告警</h3><p>更智能的方式：计算 ERROR 占总日志的比率，消除流量波动的干扰。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ErrorRatio</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>ERROR logs</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>ALL logs</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ErrorRatio} = \\frac{\\text{count}(\\text{ERROR logs}, \\Delta t)}{\\text{count}(\\text{ALL logs}, \\Delta t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ErrorRatio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ALL logs</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ERROR logs</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Loki: 5xx 占比超过 5%&#10;(&#10;  sum(rate({service_name=&quot;api-gateway&quot;} | json | status &gt;= 500 [5m]))&#10;  /&#10;  sum(rate({service_name=&quot;api-gateway&quot;} [5m]))&#10;) &gt; 0.05\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Loki: 5xx 占比超过 5%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate({service_name=\"api-gateway\"} | json | status >= 500 [5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate({service_name=\"api-gateway\"} [5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) > 0.05</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于缺失的告警-dead-man-s-switch\">基于缺失的告警（Dead Man&#39;s Switch）</h3><p>反向思维：如果<strong>应该有</strong>的日志停止出现，说明系统可能已经挂掉（进程崩溃后不会再产生日志）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- alert: HeartbeatMissing&#10;  expr: |&#10;    absent_over_time({service_name=&quot;payment-cron&quot;, msg=&quot;heartbeat&quot;} [10m])&#10;  for: 0m&#10;  labels:&#10;    severity: critical&#10;  annotations:&#10;    summary: &#39;payment-cron heartbeat missing for 10min - service may be down&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HeartbeatMissing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    absent_over_time({service_name=\"payment-cron\", msg=\"heartbeat\"} [10m])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment-cron heartbeat missing for 10min - service may be down'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于模式变化的告警\">基于模式变化的告警</h3><p>检测日志模式的突变——新的 ERROR 类型出现、日志量突增/突降：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Anomaly</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Anomaly} \\iff |x_t - \\mu_{\\text{baseline}}| &gt; k \\cdot \\sigma_{\\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Anomaly</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这类告警通常需要<a href=\"log-analytics-ml\">日志分析与异常检测</a>中的 ML 方法支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警质量工程\">告警质量工程</h2><h3 id=\"信噪比的量化\">信噪比的量化</h3><p>告警系统的价值不在于它能发多少告警，而在于每条告警是否真正需要人类行动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确率（Precision）</td>\n<td>真告警 / 总告警</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回率（Recall）</td>\n<td>被告警的故障 / 总故障</td>\n<td>&gt;95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTTA (Mean Time to Acknowledge)</td>\n<td>从告警到有人响应</td>\n<td>&lt;5min (P1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警风暴率</td>\n<td>单次事件触发的告警数</td>\n<td>&lt;5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"降噪策略\">降噪策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ALERT[原始告警] --&gt; D1{重复告警?}&#10;    D1 --&gt;|是| DEDUP[去重 - groupBy 合并]&#10;    D1 --&gt;|否| D2{是否在维护窗口?}&#10;    D2 --&gt;|是| SILENCE[静默]&#10;    D2 --&gt;|否| D3{是否依赖告警已触发?}&#10;    D3 --&gt;|是| INHIBIT[抑制 - 根因已报]&#10;    D3 --&gt;|否| D4{是否低于持续时间阈值?}&#10;    D4 --&gt;|是| PENDING[Pending 等待确认]&#10;    D4 --&gt;|否| FIRE[触发通知]\">flowchart TD\n    ALERT[原始告警] --&gt; D1{重复告警?}\n    D1 --&gt;|是| DEDUP[去重 - groupBy 合并]\n    D1 --&gt;|否| D2{是否在维护窗口?}\n    D2 --&gt;|是| SILENCE[静默]\n    D2 --&gt;|否| D3{是否依赖告警已触发?}\n    D3 --&gt;|是| INHIBIT[抑制 - 根因已报]\n    D3 --&gt;|否| D4{是否低于持续时间阈值?}\n    D4 --&gt;|是| PENDING[Pending 等待确认]\n    D4 --&gt;|否| FIRE[触发通知]</pre><p><strong>Alertmanager 的三大降噪机制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Grouping</strong>：将同类告警合并为一条通知（如同一 service 的多个 ERROR 告警合并）</li>\n<li><strong>Inhibition</strong>：当高级别告警已触发时，抑制该范围内的低级别告警</li>\n<li><strong>Silencing</strong>：在计划维护期间临时静默特定标签匹配的告警</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"管道层实时告警-otel-collector-路由\">管道层实时告警：OTel Collector 路由</h2><p>对于延迟敏感的场景（如安全事件），可以在 Collector 管道层直接触发告警而不等日志落盘：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  filter/critical:&#10;    logs:&#10;      log_record:&#10;        - &#39;severity_number &gt;= 21&#39; # FATAL&#10;        - &#39;attributes[&quot;security.event&quot;] == &quot;intrusion_detected&quot;&#39;&#10;&#10;exporters:&#10;  otlphttp/alert:&#10;    endpoint: https://alertmanager.internal:9093/api/v2/alerts&#10;&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    logs/critical:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [filter/critical]&#10;      exporters: [otlphttp/alert, otlphttp/storage]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  filter/critical</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      log_record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'severity_number >= 21'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # FATAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attributes[\"security.event\"] == \"intrusion_detected\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlphttp/alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://alertmanager.internal:9093/api/v2/alerts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logs/critical</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">filter/critical</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlphttp/alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlphttp/storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式的延迟可以降到秒级——日志从应用发出到告警触发仅需 1-3 秒，远快于依赖 Ruler 轮询（通常 1-5 分钟间隔）的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警分级与路由\">告警分级与路由</h2><p>不同级别的告警需要不同的响应速度和通知通道：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th align=\"center\">响应时间</th>\n<th>通知方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\">P1 Critical</td>\n<td>服务整体不可用 / 数据丢失风险</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;5min</td>\n<td>PagerDuty + 电话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">P2 High</td>\n<td>功能降级 / 性能严重退化</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;15min</td>\n<td>Slack 频道 + @oncall</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">P3 Medium</td>\n<td>潜在风险 / 非紧急异常</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;1h</td>\n<td>Slack 频道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">P4 Low</td>\n<td>信息性 / 趋势预警</td>\n<td align=\"center\">下个工作日</td>\n<td>邮件/工单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>路由规则在 Alertmanager 中根据告警 label（<code>severity</code>、<code>team</code>）配置——确保 DBA 团队只收到数据库相关的告警，支付团队只收到支付服务的告警。结合<a href=\"../fundamentals/log-levels-taxonomy\">日志级别与分类</a>中定义的级别体系，FATAL 自动路由为 P1，ERROR 率告警路由为 P2/P3。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>日志告警的工程核心不在于&quot;能不能发出告警&quot;，而在于&quot;每条告警是否真正需要行动&quot;。Loki Ruler + Alertmanager 是 Grafana 生态的标准方案，OTel Collector 管道层路由适合秒级延迟需求。告警质量通过精确率（&gt;80%）和四级路由（P1-P4）来量化和治理。Dead Man&#39;s Switch 模式是容易被忽视但至关重要的告警类型——系统最危险的状态往往是&quot;安静&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于日志的告警","id":"基于日志的告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"日志告警的架构模式","id":"日志告警的架构模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Loki 告警规则","id":"loki-告警规则"},{"level":2,"text":"告警类型设计","id":"告警类型设计"},{"level":3,"text":"基于计数的告警","id":"基于计数的告警"},{"level":3,"text":"基于比率的告警","id":"基于比率的告警"},{"level":3,"text":"基于缺失的告警（Dead Man's Switch）","id":"基于缺失的告警-dead-man-s-switch"},{"level":3,"text":"基于模式变化的告警","id":"基于模式变化的告警"},{"level":2,"text":"告警质量工程","id":"告警质量工程"},{"level":3,"text":"信噪比的量化","id":"信噪比的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"降噪策略","id":"降噪策略"},{"level":2,"text":"管道层实时告警：OTel Collector 路由","id":"管道层实时告警-otel-collector-路由"},{"level":2,"text":"告警分级与路由","id":"告警分级与路由"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"日志查询模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-query-patterns"},"next":{"title":"日志分析与异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-analytics-ml"}}